Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And lo and behold, it\Nwas the right choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.74,0:00:07.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Had I not spilled that fateful\Ncup of coffee, where would I be?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.04,0:00:08.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.04,0:00:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.64,0:00:12.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was supposed to work out!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.84,0:00:14.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.76,0:00:18.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you poked your nose around\Nand found Stray Cat, huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.74,0:00:22.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.48,0:00:25.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I keep Bites\Nthe Dust activated,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.20,0:00:28.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it'll function to keep my secret\Nand protect you at all cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap! I blew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.38,0:00:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the others don't have\Nlong before they get blown up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.86,0:00:42.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You tried to end me once and for all with
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.14,0:00:44.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one of Stray Cat's\Ncompressed air projectiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.68,0:00:46.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hayato,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.59,0:00:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's no way your little pea brain\Ncould have come up with such a clever
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.56,0:00:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,idea unless you'd already experienced\Nthis morning at least three or four times.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.98,0:00:57.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fact that you've lived through\Nthis morning that many times?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.40,0:01:04.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is a surefire sign that bites the dust\Nis destined to eradicate not just Rohan?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.00,0:01:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but at least one of\Nhis companions as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.54,0:01:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So your loose lips won't only sink Rohan,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.38,0:01:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but whichever one of his\Nfriends you ran your mouth to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.58,0:01:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did the would-be\Ndetectives gang up on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.44,0:01:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who have you murdered this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.42,0:01:22.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, was it a runt by the name of Koichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.78,0:01:25.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe it was Jotaro Kujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.12,0:01:28.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knowing that he's dead would make\Nthis a red-letter day indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.58,0:01:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all over!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.56,0:01:36.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'd be far too risky for me to allow\Nyou to relive any more of this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.88,0:01:38.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would expose me to an attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.64,0:01:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So once the others die, I'll\Ntemporarily disengage Bites the Dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.28,0:01:51.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bites the Dust is all-powerful!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.42,0:01:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It took a while, but luck is\Nfinally on Yoshikage Kira's side.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.10,0:01:59.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.56,0:02:03.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That name, Kira, is that your real...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.52,0:02:05.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.43,0:02:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoopsie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.35,0:02:08.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I just reveal my true\Nname to you by mistake?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.82,0:02:10.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.86,0:02:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm none other than Yoshikage Kira.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.66,0:02:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can shout it to the\Nheavens if it suits your fancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.82,0:02:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, do you have the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.58,0:02:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're dead wrong. I haven't mentioned\Nyou to anyone. I never opened my mouth to!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.56,0:02:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone because I knew exactly what would\Nhappen to them if I did so instead I
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.30,0:02:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,decided to make a call I remembered he\Nsaid he overslept and was running late
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.26,0:02:40.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I found his number and woke him up\NI didn't break any rules I just phoned
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.64,0:02:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a friend and remember one thing you're\Nthe one who revealed his own secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.32,0:02:47.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.23,0:02:49.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just stalling for\Na bit of extra time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.92,0:02:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for him to drag himself out of\Nbed and show up a little earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.94,0:03:28.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Breakdown! Breakdown!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.81,0:03:38.82,Part 4 OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HD800DC&}Let the voice of love take you higher!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.82,0:03:45.53,Part 4 OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&H71FFF9&}atsumaru chikara de toki sae koete
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.82,0:03:45.53,Part 4 OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&H71FFF9&}Our powers combined will help us surpass even time
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.82,0:03:45.53,Part 4 OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&H71FFF9&}atsumaru chikara de tokisae koete
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.49,0:03:51.50,Part 4 OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&H8500E0&}Let the joy of love give you an answer! {sounds like "Th'answer", lol}
Dialogue: 1,0:03:51.50,0:03:57.84,Part 4 OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HE700EB&}Wakare no toki sae kudakenuishi de
Dialogue: 1,0:03:51.50,0:03:57.84,Part 4 OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HE700EB&}With a meaning which is unbreakable even when we're apart
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.46,0:03:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Night to night,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:57.84,0:04:02.84,Part 4 OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&H13FBB8&}1999 Bizarre Summer
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.40,0:04:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,night is my
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.69,0:04:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Night to night, night is my soul?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.84,0:04:11.31,Part 4 OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HF36650&}Kawasu yuki ga umu sanka
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.84,0:04:11.31,Part 4 OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HF36650&}Our shared courage will give rise to a song of praise
Dialogue: 1,0:04:11.31,0:04:15.48,Part 4 OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&H9800E9&}Great Days!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.58,0:04:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Breakdown, Breakdown!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:28.83,0:04:34.17,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,513)\pos(141,890)\fs60}Episode 37: {\fs80} Crazy Diamond is Unbreakable, Part 1
Dialogue: 1,0:04:28.83,0:04:34.17,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,513)\pos(141,890)\fs60}Episode 37: {\fs80} Crazy Diamond is Unbreakable Part 1
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.75,0:04:32.33,Main,Okuyasu,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hey, Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.92,0:04:31.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Josuke!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:32.33,0:04:35.29,Main,Okuyasu,0,0,0,,{\an8}Looks like we still got here on time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.44,0:04:35.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like we're gonna make it to\Nthe big meeting on Time After All!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.34,0:04:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it! No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.92,0:04:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy, he isn't who he says he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.64,0:04:42.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if it was pure\Nchance or fate giving us a break?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.74,0:04:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I heard this guy say a certain name.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.08,0:04:46.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.84,0:04:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe it, asshole, cause I know I just\Nheard you say the name Yoshikage Kira.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.24,0:04:52.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.68,0:04:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are the chances?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.70,0:04:56.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.48,0:04:58.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not fate either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.16,0:05:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This was making a gamble and\Nlucky for me it paid off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.70,0:05:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your end has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.96,0:05:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just admit it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.86,0:05:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I heard the name\Nslither out of your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.70,0:05:10.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.48,0:05:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Murderer!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.54,0:05:18.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it turns out you and him just happened\Nto share a name, don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.60,0:05:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can heal if need be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.34,0:05:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This bastard's really Yoshikage Kira?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.96,0:05:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn that little brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.56,0:05:27.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have known he\Nwould lead me to ruin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.50,0:05:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.14,0:05:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to deactivate Bites the Dust so\NI can defend myself from these cretins!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.34,0:05:38.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Protect me, Deadly Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.80,0:05:52.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's chilly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.04,0:05:54.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must be due to all this rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.22,0:05:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, is it too much to ask for\Ncertain people to show up on time?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.36,0:06:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, there's Koichi and Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.76,0:06:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.96,0:06:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I beat the clock!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.20,0:06:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I defeated destiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.18,0:06:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was never one for rapturous hives. No,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.40,0:06:26.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so long as I avoided dispiriting loads,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.96,0:06:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was content to live\Nas carefree as a daisy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.66,0:06:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More than anything, I sought to live\Na quiet life of peace and tranquility.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.02,0:06:35.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've finally shown yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.94,0:06:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'll make it real easy to knock that
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.82,0:06:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,peace and tranquility\Nright off your new face!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.48,0:06:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, it's the dude from Rohan's picture!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.36,0:06:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would've guessed we'd end\Nup meeting the guy here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.98,0:06:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure we didn't run\Ninto him by chance, Okuyasu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.78,0:06:51.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't figured out all of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.52,0:06:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but given that he revealed his\Nreal name to Hayato Kawajiri,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.72,0:06:58.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get the feeling we showed\Nup just in the nick of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.86,0:07:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before you dullards get\Nall high and mighty,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.46,0:07:07.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should tell you I wasn't\Nrunning away despite appearances.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.26,0:07:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can obliterate any one of you the\Ninstant the thought occurs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.70,0:07:14.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I detest conflict.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.76,0:07:19.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate the very idea of it with the\Nwhite-hot intensity of a thousand suns.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.52,0:07:21.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Conflict runs completely\Ncounter to the peace
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.94,0:07:24.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and tranquility I strive\Nfor every day of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.08,0:07:28.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's really quite simple to rise\Nvictorious in a single battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.78,0:07:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, of course, the stress begins\Nto pile up before the next one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.04,0:07:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a foolish endeavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.90,0:07:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To engage in conflict is\Nto engage in futility.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.24,0:07:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You brought this shit on yourself when\Nyou murdered Shigetsu, you frickin' idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.30,0:07:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a sick son of a\Nbitch who kills for fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.72,0:07:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't get the privilege of flapping\Nthose stolen gums, you cat-eyed freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.96,0:07:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch yourself, Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.36,0:07:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure you avoid Deadly Queen's\Ncreepy bomb hand at all costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.74,0:08:03.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've already told you the reason for\Nmy not obliterating all of you earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.86,0:08:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only souls standing between me and my
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.24,0:08:08.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,eternal peace and\Ntranquility are you three.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.00,0:08:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since I've been found out, I\Nhave no choice but to fight you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.24,0:08:16.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things are about to get dicey,\NHayato, so get behind us now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.80,0:08:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.24,0:08:21.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shining Diamond's range\Nis one to two meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.16,0:08:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it corrects that which\Nhas been destroyed or altered.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.36,0:08:28.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't be fixin' you up, buddy,\Nso don't even worry about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.50,0:08:31.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A good ass-kicking's the only\Ntreatment you're getting!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.00,0:08:41.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.34,0:08:46.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dora.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.52,0:08:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.60,0:08:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't tell what happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.10,0:08:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but Kira hacking up blood and flying\Nthrough the air gets a hell yeah from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.46,0:08:58.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your deadly queen's as slow as molasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.92,0:09:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For all the killing you do,\Nyou're a real lethargic fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.88,0:09:04.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess all that peace and\Ntranquility will do that to ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.86,0:09:09.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's painfully obvious that your stand\Njust isn't cut out for one-on-one fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.50,0:09:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, he's slow, but\Ndon't let your guard down!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.98,0:09:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you wanna knock him around\Nwithout laying a finger on him,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.84,0:09:21.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's no better stand to have\Non your side than the hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.10,0:09:22.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.38,0:09:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You scrape away space\Nto transport things, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.64,0:09:32.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke was my target, but it appears fate\Nhas other ideas in mind for me today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.36,0:09:35.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm now poised to attack you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.26,0:09:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know. I'll use the Plate!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.66,0:09:43.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.66,0:09:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice, direct hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.52,0:09:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That wasn't too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.82,0:09:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially for beginners, luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.46,0:09:55.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.16,0:09:57.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't see anything. Touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.60,0:09:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the air. The air.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.62,0:10:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spit some kind of fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.24,0:10:03.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.58,0:10:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I hear him right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.60,0:10:09.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The air spit fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.20,0:10:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.16,0:10:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.74,0:10:12.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.72,0:10:15.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now this is why I kept my pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.98,0:10:19.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've found a way to use Stray Cat's air
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.26,0:10:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,-controlling abilities in\NDeadly Queen's explosions.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.96,0:10:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must thank you for carting\Nit all the way here, Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.02,0:10:29.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The invisibility of the air mixed\Nwith the power of an explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.42,0:10:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He couldn't have used a more dangerous\Ncombination of elements if he tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.92,0:10:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was growing it to do this all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.20,0:10:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm the wise guy who brought\Nthe stupid thing right to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.92,0:10:44.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did tell you luck was\Nfinally on my side, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.48,0:10:48.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the characters that make up\Nthe word luck are bringing life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.06,0:10:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How deliciously apropos.
