Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.38,0:11:04.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong, Mr. Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.68,0:11:07.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.64,0:11:11.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For a moment I thought I heard Josuke,\Nbut I guess it was just the rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.06,0:11:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quintessential Josuke, I'm\Nsure the slob overslept again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.36,0:11:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he's not here in five minutes flat,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.44,0:11:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going straight to\NHayato Kawajiri's school?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.90,0:11:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'll leave you two here\Nto wait for everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.84,0:11:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make you as\Ngood as new, Okuyasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.82,0:11:29.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's certainly a noble thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.18,0:11:34.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you see, it's time for you to explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.74,0:11:37.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That cat plant launched\Nair at him like a bullet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.46,0:11:40.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can transform air into an explosive!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.58,0:11:42.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.66,0:11:43.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to run now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.24,0:11:48.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.72,0:11:50.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's that weird bubble thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.98,0:11:51.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.89,0:11:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gonna get you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.12,0:11:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.64,0:12:03.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has the power to fix things,\Nwhich means he can heal Okuyasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.62,0:12:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To fix that which is broken,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.68,0:12:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,using your power to reassemble broken\Nstone into a wall was impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.20,0:12:12.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.22,0:12:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kay, it's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.72,0:12:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing in the world is as terrifying?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.88,0:12:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As the act of assumption!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.84,0:12:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially for those contemptible few!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.08,0:12:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who assume the false superiority.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.68,0:12:29.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of their own talents\Nand special abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.96,0:12:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yo, it's squeezing through!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.54,0:12:36.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Contact it and cause it to explode!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.96,0:12:47.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought it would at\Nleast decapitate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.64,0:12:51.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But lucky for him, the destructive\Nforce was rather shallow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.46,0:12:55.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My deadly queen's explosion is not\Nlimited to objects it directly touches.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.42,0:12:58.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thinking so was an assumption.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.44,0:13:01.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can generate an explosion\Nat any distance I wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.90,0:13:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter where you try\Nto hide or how quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.46,0:13:07.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you build a protective\Nstone wall or metal plate,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.30,0:13:10.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my bomb will slip through any\Nobstacle and execute its target.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.16,0:13:14.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't escape with your life this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.68,0:13:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.60,0:13:21.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.68,0:13:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way to dodge it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.20,0:13:24.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, dodge it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.14,0:13:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no intention of escaping.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.04,0:13:30.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the record, I would never run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.62,0:13:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How else would I heal Okuyasu's wounds?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.44,0:13:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's charging right into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.44,0:13:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It went around him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.28,0:13:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you said you could\Ndetonate that thing at any distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.82,0:13:48.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must have found the exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.02,0:13:53.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Namely, I'm just a little too close for\Ncomfort for you to try blowing me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.66,0:13:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doing that wouldn't end\Nwell for you now, would it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.60,0:14:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.96,0:14:03.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have you healed before you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.32,0:14:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't touch him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.60,0:14:07.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me on this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.80,0:14:10.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I know Kira, he's\Nalready transformed Okuyasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.88,0:14:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a bomb!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.22,0:14:17.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn that little whelp. He what? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.24,0:14:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never saw Deadly Queen lay\Neven a finger on Okuyasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.48,0:14:25.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What makes you think he\Nwas able to pull that off?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.06,0:14:28.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not a stand user,\Nso how would you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.34,0:14:29.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just do!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.28,0:14:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've lived in the same house as\Nthat psycho until this morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.48,0:14:33.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His face tells me everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.04,0:14:36.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His stand touched him\Nbefore we could notice!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.58,0:14:37.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.50,0:14:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta trust me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.58,0:14:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu's a bomb now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.18,0:14:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoshikage Kira!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.52,0:14:44.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.43,0:14:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me a moment to think.\NWell, now. Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.90,0:14:49.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stormed at me out of the blue,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.58,0:14:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I can't really say\Nwhether I touched him or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.98,0:14:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, the whole\Nincident was such a blur.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.58,0:14:57.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I should press\Nthe switch and find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.40,0:15:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Please don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.00,0:15:02.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.91,0:15:05.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just hurry up and shoot\Nyour next air missile!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.50,0:15:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Point the damn thing at me and shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.14,0:15:08.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on! Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.52,0:15:12.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, now, there's no need to be hasty\Nand end the fun so quickly, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.94,0:15:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke Higashikata,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.62,0:15:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'll observe you\Na little while longer
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.76,0:15:19.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then decide if I\Nshould obliterate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.50,0:15:25.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, you honestly have no real proof\NI turned Okuyasu into a bomb at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.32,0:15:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It might be possible to heal\Nhim with Shining Diamond.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.98,0:15:30.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could be overstepping here,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.52,0:15:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but at this point it\Nwould appear you have only
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.50,0:15:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one course of action if\Nyou want to save Okuyasu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.42,0:15:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must heal him by way of touching him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.62,0:15:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't envy the position you're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.14,0:15:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he is a human bomb,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.08,0:15:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,touching him with Shining\NDiamond may kill you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.36,0:15:51.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but Okuyasu would be spared the\Nfate of exploding into oblivion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.94,0:15:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you heal your dear\Nfriend's critical injuries,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.18,0:15:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,at least your sacrifice\Nwon't have been in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.26,0:15:59.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.17,0:16:00.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't touch him, Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.09,0:16:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll wait until you've made your decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.46,0:16:04.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you save your best friend's life?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.14,0:16:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or do you just attack me and let him die?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.72,0:16:11.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.63,0:16:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm content to wait until\Nyou make a decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.06,0:16:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it seems you're averse\Nto touching your friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.94,0:16:19.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even when it means keeping him alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.50,0:16:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have proof touching him is deadly!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.46,0:16:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know for a fact that Kira's only\Nable to control one bomb at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.70,0:16:32.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once he's activated one\Nof his freaky bomb things,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.38,0:16:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's impossible for him to fire off the\Nnext one until the first has been detonated.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.60,0:16:37.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.54,0:16:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He only used one at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.20,0:16:40.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why wouldn't he launch a bunch at once?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.00,0:16:44.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's made Okuyasu into a\Nbomb so he can't shoot now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.10,0:16:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to make a point?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.94,0:16:50.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The point is there's still a way to save\NOkuyasu, but someone needs to touch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.46,0:16:54.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.37,0:16:56.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deadly Queen, bomb switch on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.86,0:17:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that someone has gotta be me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.82,0:17:05.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.34,0:17:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.84,0:17:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shining Diamond!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.58,0:17:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're one crazy-ass SOB, Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.44,0:17:23.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Took some major balls to\Nset off the bomb like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.96,0:17:25.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure you're a grade School?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.90,0:17:27.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because that was Bites.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.28,0:17:30.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, I couldn't\Nstand around doing nothing,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.44,0:17:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I knew you had the power to heal me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.82,0:17:35.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I refuse to let any more\Ninnocent people die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.84,0:17:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, if you're gone, he'll\Noff me in the blink of an eye,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.48,0:17:40.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and he'll be free to do whatever he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.64,0:17:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a matter of time\Nbefore he kills my mom,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.18,0:17:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then he'll go after\Nmore people in this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.64,0:17:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But first, you die, though your\Npower is certainly an issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.62,0:17:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To think your stand can reverse my\Ndestructive acts in mere seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.04,0:17:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd almost forgotten\Nhow much that annoying
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.28,0:17:58.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,healing ability of yours vexes me utterly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.42,0:18:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deadly Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.86,0:18:03.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, he's gonna shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.90,0:18:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll detonate on impact, so you'll have\Nno opportunity to guard. Then again,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.92,0:18:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you could sidestep the explosive\Nif you happen to see it,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.86,0:18:22.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I've launched one so small\Nit's almost impossible to detect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.44,0:18:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With Okuyasu on your back and\Nthose painful shrapnel wounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.32,0:18:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can you really dodge a projectile?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.44,0:18:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just get the hell out of there, Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.50,0:18:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the explosion so much as brushes\Nagainst you, you'll be a dead man!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.64,0:18:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I healed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.76,0:18:36.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why haven't you woken up yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.64,0:18:38.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Open those beady eyes, Okuyasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.06,0:18:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bomb's on its way!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.18,0:18:41.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.09,0:18:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only eight more meters until impact.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.20,0:18:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, enough goofing around, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.08,0:18:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to wake up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.16,0:18:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're as good as new, Okuyasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.80,0:18:48.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chusuke, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.26,0:18:50.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seven meters to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.26,0:18:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you leave me, dick!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.72,0:18:53.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Open your damn eyes! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.10,0:18:57.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, man, quit napping and\Nopen your freaking eyes! Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.96,0:19:02.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you wake up, we can knock the shit out\Nof this asshole just like we always do!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.38,0:19:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chusuke, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.04,0:19:08.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like joe montana throwing the\Ntouchdown pass of a winning game,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.94,0:19:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'll detonate the sucker\Nin the perfect position.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.46,0:19:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and go home victorious.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.78,0:19:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four meters until impact.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.00,0:19:17.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go! Right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.72,0:19:20.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've gotta run for it or\Nit's gonna hit you dead on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.50,0:19:23.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry about Okuyasu,\Nbut he's already...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.22,0:19:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, don't say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.40,0:19:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only one of us who needs\Nto run here is you, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.98,0:19:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two meters till showtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.82,0:19:32.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With a three meter radius, they're\Nsure to die in the explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.58,0:19:35.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.72,0:19:39.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's two meters in front of\Nyou and it's closing in fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.24,0:19:40.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've gotta run now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.66,0:19:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.76,0:19:43.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu's gone! He's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.44,0:19:44.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Accept it already!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.42,0:19:46.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's nowhere near dead, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.60,0:19:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's back in top form and he'll\Nopen his eyes any minute now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.94,0:19:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, just one more meter and then\Npop goes the riff-raff. Josuke!
