Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.86,0:20:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy heck!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.04,0:20:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was ruptured by a blade of blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.52,0:20:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did Josuke somehow take\Nhis blood and propel
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.06,0:20:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it with so much force\Nthat it cut like a knife?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.20,0:20:12.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.80,0:20:14.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just like that time in the attic.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.64,0:20:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The air shackles deflated when I\Npunctured them with a compass needle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.88,0:20:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He used the blood from his wound\Nlike a water jet cutter. Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.32,0:20:28.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he severed the bullet clean through.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.42,0:20:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice try, but it didn't do you any good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.88,0:20:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta move!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.14,0:20:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They didn't deflate!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.24,0:20:39.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This improvised air bullet explosive\Nis stabilized by Deadly Queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.40,0:20:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so it won't deflate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.20,0:20:44.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can split it, smash\Nit, or dice it to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.12,0:20:47.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm pleased to say the\Nbomb will never lose its power.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.86,0:20:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, back to our\Nregularly scheduled explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.44,0:20:53.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Touchdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.74,0:20:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.24,0:20:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's floating?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.76,0:20:59.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.64,0:21:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, this isn't floating!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.46,0:21:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shining Diamond won't\Nallow me to heal myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.08,0:21:15.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which, to be frank, would\Ncome in handy right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.54,0:21:17.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But when it comes to pieces of road,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.64,0:21:20.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like the ones that got lodged\Nin me from the first blast,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.78,0:21:23.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's a whole different story.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.18,0:21:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a super neat idea, using\Nthe road to pull you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.20,0:21:30.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm out of options.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.34,0:21:33.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't live here, but it'll\Nwork as our safe house for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.72,0:21:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, you have to leave Okuyasu.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.04,0:21:39.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you keep carrying him\Naround, you're gonna get killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.98,0:21:42.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll find a way to corner\Nyou, and that'll be it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.24,0:21:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I asked you to keep quiet, so drop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.60,0:21:47.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu and I have a connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.42,0:21:48.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.34,0:21:49.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't abandon him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.50,0:21:51.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's not what I'm trying to say!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.54,0:21:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the time you healed\NOkuyasu, he was already dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.54,0:21:56.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.45,0:21:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.37,0:21:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not another word. I mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.28,0:22:00.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to focus your\Nenergy on beating Kira!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.24,0:22:05.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How irksome.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.92,0:22:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That blasted ability to correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.30,0:22:10.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without it, my bomb would be unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.02,0:22:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see now that the greatest\Nobstacle standing in the
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.94,0:22:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,way of my attaining peace\Nand tranquility isn't Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.10,0:22:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.50,0:22:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke Higashikata.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.89,0:22:53.26,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Any time I need to see your face, I just close my eyes
Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.26,0:22:55.52,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And I am taken to a place where your crystal mind
Dialogue: 1,0:22:55.52,0:22:58.31,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And magenta feelings take up shelter in the base of my spine
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.31,0:22:59.98,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Sweet like a chic-a-cherry cola
Dialogue: 1,0:22:59.98,0:23:02.36,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I don't need to try to explain, I just hold on tight
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.36,0:23:04.73,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And if it happens again, I might move so slightly
Dialogue: 1,0:23:04.73,0:23:07.53,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}To the arms and the lips and the face of the human cannonball
Dialogue: 1,0:23:07.53,0:23:09.24,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}That I need to, I want to
Dialogue: 1,0:23:09.24,0:23:11.49,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Come stand a little bit closer
Dialogue: 1,0:23:11.49,0:23:13.83,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Breathe in and get a bit higher
Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.83,0:23:15.45,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}You'll never know what hit you
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.45,0:23:18.08,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}When I get to you
Dialogue: 1,0:23:18.08,0:23:22.58,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I want you, I don't know if I need you, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.58,0:23:26.13,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I'd die to find out
Dialogue: 1,0:23:27.13,0:23:31.59,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I want you, I don't know if I need you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.12,0:23:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you, but I don't know if I\Nneed you, but I'm trying to find you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:31.59,0:23:34.97,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I would die to find out
